* sg13g2-pll :: sim/sg13cmos5l-vco-decap-momcap (issue #23, Part of #16)
* Single-device AC extraction of vco.XCDECAP (cap_cmomi, w=70u l=70u -- the
* same instance parameters as ../netlist-snapshots/vco.spice's XCDECAP line),
* at the MOM-model-uncertainty fraction and temperature run.sh substitutes.
* Same methodology and same rationale for representing the uncertainty band
* as a parallel ideal capacitor as
* ../../sg13cmos5l-loop-filter-momcap/testbench/tb_extract_c.sp.tmpl -- see
* that file's header for the full justification (not repeated here).
*
* Template placeholders: @MOM_FRAC@ is applied by run.sh directly to the
* nominal capacitance value in its own post-processing (this file measures
* the nominal cap_cmomi value only; run.sh scales it), @TEMP@ (degC).

.include $PDK_ROOT/$PDK/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cap_cmomi.lib
.option scale=1 temp=@TEMP@

Xcap n1 0 cap_cmomi w=70u l=70u mmin=1 mmax=4 feed=double subblock=0 m=1 mm_ok=1
Rbleed n1 0 1e14
Iac n1 0 dc 0 ac 1

.control
ac dec 5 1k 100k
let cnom = abs(1/(2*3.14159265*frequency*imag(v(n1))))
print cnom
.endc
.end
